      "kind": "noul",
      "ask": "Does the public contract positively identify this binding as implementation-only, with no supported external role?",
      "note": "Distinguish a recommendation from an exclusion. \"Most applications should use A\" leaves room for supported uses of B. \"Only A is covered by the client contract\" excludes B when B is identified as a backing operation. The name of the component that uses B is insufficient on its own.",
      "levels": null,
